    <item><headword id="d0e319" type="heading" level="h1">4. Sheep’s appearance</headword></item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e324">[sgrogag]</headword>
      <description>Caora bheag, nùlach le sgrogagan beag de dh adhaircean oirre. (‘Sgrogag’ has the same nasal sound as ‘crocan’ (‘cnocan’, a hillock).)</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e333">[liabhach]</headword>
      <description>Caora bheag mhollach le adhaircean liabhach (wide-spread).</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e342">caora-ghireach</headword>
      <description>short wool.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e351">caora-mhaol</headword>
      <description>no horns.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e360">caora-chiar</headword>
