    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e681">an doille ()</headword>
      <description>[fem.] blindness, the eye turning whitish, opaque.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e690">an tuathalan ()</headword>
      <description>[masc.] giddiness; lack of balance.</description>
