    <item>
      <headword id="d0e717">spùt</headword>
      <description>diarrhoea.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e726">lot ()</headword>
      <description>[fem.] lot air a sgamhan, a blemish on the lungs.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e735">a’ cleith a’ bhoinne</headword>
      <description>withholding the milk; ‘Cha do leag i ’m boinne.’</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e744">Tha galair innt.</headword>
      <description>She has a disease (not specific).</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e753">Tha gaod innt.</headword>
      <description>She has a disease (not specific). Similarly, a blemish in a piece of sound-looking wood: ‘Tha gaod ann.’</description>
    </item>
